<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech real Sept PPI rises 3.9 percent yr/yr - CSU.</title>
<headline>Czech real Sept PPI rises 3.9 percent yr/yr - CSU.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer prices rose 0.3 percent in September putting prices 3.9 percent higher than in the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Friday.</p>
</text>
